------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT THIS MEANS FOR A RATING BUDGET
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  perceived_empathy: the judge carries too little signal to substitute here.
  Keep the human panel; the judge can pre-screen but not replace.

  actual_help: the judge carries too little signal to substitute here.
  Keep the human panel; the judge can pre-screen but not replace.

  The calibration itself needs human ratings, and it expires: a new
  judge model, a new domain or a changed rubric all move these
  numbers. This is a recurring measurement, not a one-off setting.

